    "observedInstructions": [
      "For Pets = Loose Dog and Is the animal owned = No, inline instruction: Park Rangers do not have the capability of capturing loose dogs…; Yes adds no further fields. Prohibited Activity = Homeless Encampment displays: The Parks and Recreation Department DOES NOT address Homeless Encampment concerns! and a New Service Type Suggestion popup that recommended Park Maintenance/Misc itself. Illegal Dumping adds a required checkbox group for dumped item types. Maintenance options Construction Repairs, Dead Animal, Irrigation, and Trash Cans each add a subquestion; Dead Animal kind Other adds a required description. Sprayground selection under Pool/Water adds a sprayground issue select. All Park and Trail primary issue categories were inspected; subcategory lists and their downstream fields were checked."
    ],
    "contactStepObserved": "Contact step showed optional consent. First Name, Last Name, Email, Phone Number, Address, City, State, Zipcode were disabled by default. Contact-preference radio answers did not add more form fields.",
