    {
      "tagline": "Submit a 311 request about maintenance or other concerns in a Dallas park or trail.",
      "why": "For maintenance concerns in Dallas parks, trails, athletic fields, recreation centers, and other Park & Recreation properties, including restrooms, pavilions, playgrounds, trees, pools, sports amenities, litter, irrigation, graffiti, park lights, or damaged structures. The 311 request form asks for the park or trail, issue type, specific concern, and location.",
      "why_not": "The Park & Recreation Department does not address homeless encampment concerns through this service, and Park Rangers cannot capture unowned loose dogs.",
      "what": "Submit 311 request",
      "who": "Park & Recreation",
      "how": "Go to Dallas 311 > Choose \"City Parks and Trails\" > Choose \"Park Maintenance/Misc\"",
      "how_formatted": "[Go to Dallas 311](https://dallascrm.my.site.com/public/s/) > Choose \"City Parks and Trails\" > Choose \"Park Maintenance/Misc\""
